  "construction": "Two-sheeted cyclic cover of the {4,5} surface code [[360,38,8]] of the orientably-regular map R19.3 (M. Conder's list of reflexible maps of genus 2 to 301, genus 19; the board entry 360-38-8 is this base code). Base group G = <r,s | r^4, s^5, (r*s)^2, s*r^-2*s^2*r*s^-1*r^2*s^-1*r*s*r^-1*s^-1*r*s> of order 720; darts = elements of G (right multiplication), faces g<r>, vertices g<s>, edges g<rs> = {g, grs}. Voltage omega in Z/2 on the base edges, equal to 1 exactly on the 41 edges {w, w*r*s} for w in: r^-1*s^-1; s*r^-1; s^-2; r^-1*s^-2; s^-2*r; r*s^-2*r*s^-1; r^-1*s*r^-1*s^-1*r; s^-2*r*s^-1*r; r^2*s^-2*r*s^-1; r*s*r^-1*s^-1*r*s^-1; r*s^2*r^-1*s*r^-1; s*r^-1*s^-1*r*s^-2; s^-1*r*s^-2*r*s^-1; r^2*s^2*r^-1*s*r^-1; r*s*r^-1*s*r^-1*s^-2; r*s^-1*r*s*r^-1*s*r^-1; r^-1*s*r^-1*s^-1*r*s^-1*r; s^-2*r*s^-1*r*s^-1*r; r^2*s*r^-1*s^-1*r*s^-1*r; r^2*s^-1*r*s*r^-1*s*r^-1; r^2*s^-1*r*s*r^-1*s^-2; r^2*s^-1*r*s^-1*r*s^-2; r*s*r^-1*s^-1*r*s^-2*r; r^-1*s*r^-1*s^-1*r*s^-1*r*s^-1; s*r^-1*s^-1*r*s^-1*r*s*r^-1; s^-1*r*s^2*r^-1*s*r^-1*s^-1; s^-1*r*s^-1*r*s*r^-1*s*r^-1; s^-1*r*s^-1*r*s*r^-1*s^-2; r^2*s*r^-1*s*r^-1*s^-1*r*s^-1; r^2*s*r^-1*s^2*r^-1*s*r^-1; r^2*s*r^-1*s^-1*r*s^-1*r*s^-1; r*s*r^-1*s*r^-1*s*r^-1*s^-1*r; r*s^-1*r*s^-1*r*s^-2*r*s^-1; r^-1*s*r^-1*s*r^-1*s^-2*r*s^-1; r^-1*s^-1*r*s*r^-1*s*r^-1*s^-2; s*r^-1*s*r^-1*s^-2*r*s^-1*r; r^2*s^-1*r*s^-1*r*s^-1*r*s*r^-1; r^2*s^-1*r*s^-1*r*s^-1*r*s^-2; r*s*r^-1*s*r^-1*s*r^-1*s^-1*r*s^-1; r*s^2*r^-1*s*r^-1*s^-2*r*s^-1; r^-1*s^-1*r*s*r^-1*s*r^-1*s*r^-1*s^-1. Cover darts (g,i), g in G, i in Z/2, with R~(g,i) = (g r, i + omega(g)) and S~(g,i) = (g s, i), omega(g) the voltage of the edge through g; faces, vertices and edges are the cycles of R~, S~ and R~S~: (V,E,F) = (288,720,360), genus 37. Qubits on the 720 edges, X-checks on the 288 vertices (weight 5), Z-checks on the 360 faces (weight 4), incidences mod 2, so k = 2 - chi = 74. Not a regular map (no orientably-regular {4,5} map of genus 37 exists). The qubit order is that of the public package in the references (data/maps.json: base darts and a cohomologous voltage with 87 edges), whose src/rebuild.py rebuilds these matrices and checks the isomorphism with the cover above.",
